  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Avfallsf&#xf6;rbr&#xe4;nning 06-09</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Waste burning 06-09</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">3 Avfallsf&#xf6;rbr&#xe4;nning i utvecklingsl&#xe4;nder under primitiva f&#xf6;rh&#xe5;llanden kan ge upphov till farliga &#xe4;mnen. Emissionsfaktorer for avfallsf&#xf6;rbr&#xe4;nning ska tas fram med praktiska f&#xf6;rbr&#xe4;nningsf&#xf6;rs&#xf6;k i Mexico och Kina. Denna information kommer att anv&#xe4;ndas i arbetet med Stockholmskonventionen om farliga &#xe4;mnen.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">3 Burning of waste in the open without any technical equipment produc hazardous substances. The emission factors are not sufficiently developed and especially not for developing countries. The aim of this project is to develop emission factors for developing countries conditions and to communicate this to the countries. The practical tests in Mexico and China. Will be used for Stockholm Convention.</narrative>
  </description>
